# Own the private lifecycle of one ordinary streaming child process.
# Authority: pipes, start, process-group ownership, no-reap observation, first cause,
# bounded teardown, exact sole wait, external output ownership, and cached completion.
# Invariants: natural SIGKILL remains an error; cleanup EPERM remains an error; the kernel
# never steals buffered output; all workers join and every successful start reaps exactly once.
# Dependency: closed RK1UO native exit observer commit 19fabd7.
# Deferred: public adapters (RK1ULA), privileged sudo (RK1P).
version=2
slice_id=rk1ulk-private-lifecycle-kernel
state=tests-red
max_total_files=2
max_production_files=1
max_changed_lines=790
ignore=tasks/pi-agent-integration-spec.md
allow=internal/runner/streaming_lifecycle.go
allow=internal/runner/streaming_lifecycle_test.go
allow=tasks/slice-commit-ledger.tsv
test=internal/runner/streaming_lifecycle_test.go
